  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">BPSC DSO/ AD Mains Result 2026</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-08-11T11:48:02+05:30\">August 11, 2026</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">11:48 am</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"http://www.bpsc.bih.nic.in/\">Bihar Public Service Commission (BPSC)</a>,</strong> has released the<strong> Mains Result </strong>on its\u00a0<strong>official website</strong> for the Recruitment of <strong>DSO/ AD\u00a0</strong><strong>Examination 2026.</strong>\u00a0The<strong> mains exam</strong> was conducted on<strong> 29 \u2013 30 January 2026</strong>, and the last date to submit the application form was\u00a0<strong data-end=\"250\" data-start=\"230\">24 June 2025</strong>. Candidates Can Check their <strong>Mains Result\u00a0</strong>using\u00a0their\u00a0<strong data-end=\"362\" data-start=\"302\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong> by logging into the <strong>portal. The direct link</strong> is provided below. <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>(Advt. No. 38/2025)</strong></span></span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .social-button {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n  