ont-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> When will the <strong>BPSC DSO / Assistant Director Mains Result 2026</strong> be released?</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Answer:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> The Mains Result has announced through an official <strong>BPSC notification.</strong></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> Where can I check the <strong>Mains Result?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> In the <strong>\u201cNotices / Advertisement / Latest Updates\u201d</strong> section on the BPSC official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> Will the <strong>Mains Result be available in PDF format?</strong></span></span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, BPSC publishes the result in a <strong>downloadable PDF.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> Do I need to log in to check the <strong>exam date?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><s